==Trivia==
When starting the game, if a player chooses a {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}}: Mewtwo pack to open as their first pack, it will always contain the double rare version of this card.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Marowak}}.
*{{m|Bonemerang}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Marowak}} can learn.

